      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729234600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 67317,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729240933333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729242933333
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Diaz. Order 788-1B45.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 67317,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729248933333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I see the order here for the ProForm cycling shoes. What specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729250866666
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. They're terrible.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 67317,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729258399999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. That definitely sounds uncomfortable. To understand better, is it a technical fault with the shoe, like a defect with the cleats mechanism, or more of a sizing and preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729261266665
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know. They just don't fit right. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 67317,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729275133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I understand. Let me just check the purchase date... I see they were delivered to you about 40 days ago. One moment while I review our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765729279466664
